<title>USA: Sioux Falls hogs off $0.25 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls hogs off $0.25 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were $0.25 lower. Trading was fairly active. Top $59.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3    220-260 lbs   59.00-59.50</p>
<p>		  260-270 lbs   58.50-59.00</p>
<p>    US 2-3    270-280 lbs   57.50-58.50</p>
<p>		  280-290 lbs   56.50-57.50</p>
<p>    US 3-4    290-300 lbs   55.50-56.50</p>
<p> Sows - up $1.00/off $2.00. Top $53.00.</p>
<p>    US 1-3    300-450 lbs    47.50-49.00</p>
<p>		  450-500 lbs    50.00</p>
<p>		  500-650 lbs    51.00-52.00, few to 53.00</p>
</text>
